<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s199S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w1">log g-yem</span> gyi ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w2">bshang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w3">gci</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w4">&#x27;dam rdzab</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s199p1">ljan ljin dang mi gtsang ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w5">dri nga ba</span> mang ba dang nyam nga ba dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w6">nyams mi dga&#x27; ba</span>&#x27;o</span>
