<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s199S">Because you have done <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w1">wrong sex</span>, you live in a place where there is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w3">piss</span> and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w2">shit</span> all around, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w4">mud and dirt</span> and <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s199p1">filth</span>, and everything <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w5">stinks</span>, and everywhere seems <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w6">unpleasant</span> and distasteful.</span>
