<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first independent proposal. The two impurity terms ljan ljin and mi gtsang ba share the single English filth; retained together at phrase depth without a false individual null. nyams mi dga' ba owns unpleasant; nyam nga ba and distasteful remain unassigned because their atomic correspondence is uncertain despite the glossary's distasteful entry. mang ba is distributed through the expanded environmental description and is omitted. Supplied causal framing, participants and auxiliaries remain unwrapped.</div>
